*    City of New York.                                                *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
* TBBITS - TBLUK EQUATES
         SPACE 1
* bits defined in leftmost byte of TB$FLG (global table options) [1.22]
         SPACE 1
TBT#SEQ  EQU       X'80' sequential unsorted table               [1.22]
TBT#RGT  EQU       X'40' right-adjusted search instead of left   [1.22]
TBT#EXAC EQU       X'20' Return only exact matches
         SPACE 1
* TBLUK table entry flags used in TBS$FLG in the TBS string
         SPACE 1
TB#NOM   EQU       X'80'               RETURN A NO MATCH EVEN IF THIS
*                                      ENTRY MATCHES
TB#AMB   EQU       X'40'               RETURN AN AMBIGUOUS MATCH
*                                      EVEN IF THIS ENTRY MATCHES
TB#RSV1  EQU       X'20'               RESERVED
TB#USR1  EQU       X'10'               AVAILABLE TO THE USER
TB#USR2  EQU       X'08'
TB#USR3  EQU       X'04'
TB#USR4  EQU       X'02'
TB#USR5  EQU       X'01'
*COPY    TBGLOB
         GBLA      &TBLEN,&TBCNT,&TBFLG
         GBLC      &TBNAME,&TBVAL(1000),&TBDSP(1000)
         GBLC      &TBMAX
